Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.97,0:00:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, get closer to me. Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Auntie... {???????????? I like to think this episode is about actual incest} {Nah, it's about a cougar who has sex with young swallow birds, but auntie fits because she's older than them}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.94,0:00:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, sweetie. {可愛い子ちゃん}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.49,0:00:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's autumn already...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.16,0:00:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... It's time for me \Nto return to the southern lands.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.23,0:00:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be until next spring \Nthat you come again, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.93,0:01:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.64,0:01:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... I can't fly well...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.69,0:01:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Young swallows are nice, \Nbut they always have to leave me one day.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.38,0:01:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Auntie...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.65,0:01:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Swallow?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.41,0:01:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Otake-san. \NI'm Otake, the hill myna. {common hill mynah (Gracula religiosa)}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.32,0:01:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, that one wet blanket swallow \Nisn't worth your anguish!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.73,0:01:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try letting me take care of you?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.90,0:01:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, don't be shy—\NI can treat you real well, trust me.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.19,0:01:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... I just don't feel like it right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.62,0:01:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There—look who's here!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.55,0:01:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So stylishly dressed!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.83,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They sure know a thing or two \Nabout looking slick. {スマート usually means cool, slick}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.58,0:02:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't just stare at them, try to wave! {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.61,0:02:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.07,0:02:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that, lady? Isn't he handsome? \NYou must be stunned. I knew he'd be to your liking!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.90,0:02:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now, you don't need to pose like that! {??????????????????}{don't feel like writing out this one}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.04,0:02:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're annoying me! \NCome on, get going!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.68,0:02:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how old are you? {????????}{dou ikutsu}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.10,0:02:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a shy type, I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.66,0:02:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we go for a walk?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.52,0:02:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.41,0:02:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So the cool guys aren't you thing, huh? {??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.76,0:02:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try out some different types, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.91,0:02:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look, if the man is as quiet as that last guy, there's no appeal.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.91,0:02:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll find a talkative guy \Nthat's just to your liking, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.63,0:03:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,See? This guy is full of life!\NSo hurry up and make an acquaintance!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.91,0:03:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Live the moment! {????}{いかすんだってば}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.10,0:03:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how beautiful.\NOh, how lovely!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.65,0:03:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how fair! You and I must swim together!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.38,0:03:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean it! You'd look gorgeous in a swimsuit!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.00,0:03:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please, let me see it!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.57,0:03:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, his clamorous entreating bore fruit!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.72,0:03:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What a geesy guy! {gachou-na = like a goose}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.82,0:04:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Goosewife! {gachan - also imitating gachou = goose}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.30,0:04:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Husband! What's the deal with you turning into a human, you cheater?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.03,0:04:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've got time to play, \Nthen go and bring us some food!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.02,0:04:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and bring us some food!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.94,0:04:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Goose...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.63,0:04:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Goosewife, give me a break!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.34,0:04:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? Am I not good enough for just a normal man, one not persecuted by his wife?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.59,0:04:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.36,0:04:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll definitely bring you a man \Nwho's both masculine and single.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.72,0:04:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.27,0:04:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Kite, flying so stylishly, \Nplease come down and join us.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.87,0:04:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,His aura feels just right. {/mood - isn't she commenting on the atmosphere of the Kite, his aura?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.15,0:04:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need something from me, get on with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.69,0:04:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I can't say it out loud.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.61,0:05:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Fly out of here!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.35,0:05:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that was too much! \NI'll make you take it back!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.86,0:05:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, people!\NCome hear what these two are up to! {https://jisho.org/word/%E7%AD%92%E6%8A%9C%E3%81%91 - means it literally: come see as I leak their conversations}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.70,0:05:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... I'm going to... \NI'm almost there, boy...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.88,0:05:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not there!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.45,0:05:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Love, love, love you.\NI love you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost at that point, boy...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.36,0:05:53.02,Overlap,,0,0,0,,My, how embarrassing!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My little boy...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.34,0:05:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You prick...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.66,0:05:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.32,0:06:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too noisy!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.49,0:06:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.72,0:06:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll go good with sake. {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.32,0:06:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on a minute. What were you hoping to achieve with such a non-committal guy? {????? halfway; half measures; unfinished; incomplete; by halves; half-baked; half-cocked; half-hearted; half-arsed; half-assed​} {talking about the previous one}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.97,0:06:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure someone like him \Nwould love you with passion!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.72,0:06:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose, but he looks a little preoccupied.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.32,0:06:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you sure you can handle it? {?????????????}{あんたまだ入ていいじゃない}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.10,0:06:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You are? {?????}{えー？入り}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.32,0:06:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no-no-no! No!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.27,0:06:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his deal? \NA few kisses do {\i1}that{\i0} to him?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.31,0:06:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course! \NHe's quite fond of kissing, you see.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.93,0:06:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I would probably prefer \Na more composed type.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.88,0:07:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,OK! I'm sure there's someone intelligent in our feathered kind.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.00,0:07:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But dammit. \NYou'll have to give me some time to think.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.46,0:07:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you? \NJust take a look at that!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.50,0:07:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He feels a little somber to me... {sour (look); glum; grim; sullen; sulky​ / stingy}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.13,0:07:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.72,0:07:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, out for a walk? Are you here alone?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.53,0:07:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I join you, unless I'm intruding?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.92,0:07:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I do love the smell of the night.\NDo you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.46,0:07:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It depends...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.92,0:07:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I do find it to my liking. There is something deeply invigorating in the night air.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.01,0:07:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.12,0:07:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"O night, thou maketh the women most bolder{more accurately shakespearean}..."\NHave you heard that poem before?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.60,0:07:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but doesn't it make men bolder as well?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.30,0:07:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps... That one passage \Nis all I remember from it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.92,0:08:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This persimmon looks like it'll fall down soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.30,0:08:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you pick it for me, dear?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.72,0:08:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, when wait thou cannot, a little canario with yer body shall bringeth you the fruit... {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.72,0:08:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I just improvized another poem.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.72,0:08:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there was some insect. \NOh, no, it fell inside my dress!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.15,0:08:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... It's on my back now!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.72,0:08:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, if thee calleth me to approach your back... {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.89,0:08:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please don't watch. Oh, my...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.83,0:08:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My, I'm so embarrassed...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.72,0:08:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.89,0:08:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.15,0:09:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... My eyes... they are... ! {???} {blabbering nonsense as he falls asleep}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.00,0:09:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel numb...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.38,0:09:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's our new candidate!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.73,0:09:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... If you could find a red flower for me...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.84,0:09:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.27,0:10:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.07,0:10:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings! It's truly been years, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But worry not—my love never died! {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.09,0:10:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The memories of us building that nest together are still fresh in my memory...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.59,0:10:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A hunter's shot left me with this wound, \Nyet I managed to survive through it,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.92,0:10:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just to finally meet you here!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.51,0:10:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.79,0:10:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there are no more birds \Nleft, you see... I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.92,0:11:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's your turn, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.36,0:11:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've learned a lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.08,0:11:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the bird you want \Nis a migratory bird, after all. {amazing subtext throughout the episode, I'm impressed; although her wanting to fuck all those birds was a little sus...}
